Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.80,0:04:32.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}后来降到60个 现在还剩49个
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.80,0:04:32.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Then it was 60, and now there's 49.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.48,0:04:35.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}据说到了2030年就没有了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.48,0:04:35.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And they say that by 2030, there won't be any.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.80,0:04:41.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}关于屠宰场的政府法规一天一变
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.80,0:04:41.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The legislation from the government on abattoirs changes every five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.48,0:04:43.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}让经营一家屠宰场 变得几乎不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.48,0:04:43.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Makes it virtually impossible to run an abattoir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.88,0:04:44.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.88,0:04:44.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.88,0:04:47.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}还说从农场到餐桌呢 政府会 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.88,0:04:47.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So all that farm-to-fork, you know, the government's gone, "Yes, farm"...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.96,0:04:49.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这太疯狂了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.96,0:04:49.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's utterly crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.28,0:04:52.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}当地人无法买我们的猪肉 当地人无法购买任何本地猪肉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.28,0:04:52.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Nobody local can buy our pork, nobody local can buy any local pork,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.00,0:04:54.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}因为我们无法在本地屠宰了 这么说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.00,0:04:54.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}because we can't get it slaughtered locally, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.96,0:05:00.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们的猪 现在只有一条出路 就是去超市
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.96,0:05:00.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}All our pigs are now in one basket, so to speak, and going to the supermarket.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.84,0:05:02.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}但是那样 好吧 那谁来屠宰
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.84,0:05:02.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But that's totally... Yeah, but who's slaughtering them?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.40,0:05:04.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}坐三个小时的卡车运到别处
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.40,0:05:04.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}They go on a three-hour lorry trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.64,0:05:06.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}所以你把你的猪赶上一辆大卡车
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.64,0:05:06.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So you just put yours on a huge great lorry
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.52,0:05:09.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}运到工业屠宰场
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.52,0:05:09.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}which goes off to an industrial slaughterhouse?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.28,0:05:10.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}没错
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.28,0:05:10.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.28,0:05:13.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}但是当你有 下周我有39头要出栏
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.28,0:05:13.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But when you've already got... I've got 39 ready to go next week.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.08,0:05:16.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}对 货车和冲洗的费用
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.08,0:05:16.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, the cost of the lorry and the washing-out, that is just...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.96,0:05:19.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}没错 太贵了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.96,0:05:19.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Exactly, it's all just too expensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.28,0:05:23.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我不知道该怎么办了 我得为下周想个办法
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.28,0:05:23.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, I don't know what to do. I've got to work out something for next week,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.88,0:05:25.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}因为它们已经可以出栏了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.88,0:05:25.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}'cause they're all ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.28,0:05:28.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}祝你好运 对 祝你好运
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.28,0:05:28.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Good luck. Yeah, good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.92,0:05:32.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}由于我的养猪场规模很小
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.92,0:05:32.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Because my pig enterprise was quite small,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.12,0:05:36.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我实在是没有能力租卡车
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.12,0:05:36.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}there was no way I could afford to hire my own lorry
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.44,0:05:39.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}把猪运到远方的屠宰场
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.44,0:05:39.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}to go to a far-away abattoir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.52,0:05:43.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不过 我不得不 把这个问题暂时放在一边
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.52,0:05:43.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}However, I had to put that problem on the back burner,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.56,0:05:48.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}因为我要带丽莎去看我找到的酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.56,0:05:48.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}because I needed to show Lisa a pub I'd found.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.24,0:05:50.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你有商业计划了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.24,0:05:50.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Have you got a business plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.68,0:05:53.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 是一家爱尔兰式酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.68,0:05:53.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. You know an Irish pub, I'm not sure
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.52,0:05:55.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不确定现在还是不是 反正以前是的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.52,0:05:55.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}it's the same now, but it used to be...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.64,0:05:57.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你看过以后告诉我吧 毕竟你是爱尔兰人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.64,0:05:57.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, you tell me actually, 'cause you're Irish.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.80,0:05:59.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}爱尔兰式酒吧看起来是一家酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.80,0:05:59.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}In Ireland, it seemed to me to be a pub
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.64,0:06:02.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}另一方面 又是一个小商店 乡村商店
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.64,0:06:02.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}and then on the other side, you had like a village shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.36,0:06:03.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.36,0:06:03.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.64,0:06:07.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}之所以会这样 是因为爱尔兰的男人是周五领工资
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.64,0:06:07.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The reason why they did that is 'cause all the men would get paid on a Friday,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.52,0:06:10.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}领到工资后会去 妻子会让他们去买面包和黄油
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.52,0:06:10.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}and the wife would go : "Would you get some bread and butter?"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.64,0:06:12.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}他们会带着所有工资去酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.64,0:06:12.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And he'd go off with all his wages, go to the pub,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.08,0:06:16.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}把工资全部用来买酒喝 喝得烂醉地回到家
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.08,0:06:16.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}and drink it all and come home absolutely smashed and--
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.28,0:06:18.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}然后没买面包和黄油 是的 全忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.28,0:06:18.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And not buy the bread and butter. No, forget everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.40,0:06:21.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}所以酒吧有一半是小商店
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.40,0:06:21.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So half of the pub was a little shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.00,0:06:24.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}男人一走进酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.00,0:06:24.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And as soon as the man went in,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.32,0:06:27.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}酒保就会接过他的购物清单 把东西包好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.32,0:06:27.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}the barman would take his shopping list, pack it all up,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.56,0:06:30.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}扣除买东西的钱 剩下的钱给他喝酒
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.56,0:06:30.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}take the money out and then give him the rest of the money to drink away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.36,0:06:33.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}当他离开酒吧时 当他踉跄着出门时
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.36,0:06:33.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And as he was leaving, he'd leave... As the man was stumbling out,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.64,0:06:35.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}酒保会把袋子塞到他手里
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.64,0:06:35.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}and he'd put the bag in his hand and say:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.88,0:06:37.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}告诉他 "把这个拿给你老婆"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.88,0:06:37.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}"Take that back to your wife, now."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.68,0:06:39.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这就是我的商业计划
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.68,0:06:39.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That is my business plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.08,0:06:42.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}如果我们有一个酒吧和商店的组合体
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.08,0:06:42.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}If we have a pub and a shop in the same place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.88,0:06:45.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}也许再加上肉店 加上肉店就太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.88,0:06:45.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Probably a butcher shop as well. A butcher shop would be great!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.12,0:06:48.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道 你就可以去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.12,0:06:48.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I know. So you can then go...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.52,0:06:52.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你就可以去酒吧的同时 顺便采购一周的生活用品
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.52,0:06:52.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You can go to the pub and also do your weekly shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.08,0:06:55.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}现在人们是在加油的同时 采购一周的生活用品
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.08,0:06:55.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}'Cause at the moment, people go and buy petrol and do their weekly shop
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.00,0:06:58.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}在加油站的超市 对
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.00,0:06:58.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}in the supermarket at the petrol station.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.36,0:07:02.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}多少 文明怎么会发展到这个地步
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.36,0:07:02.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}How much... How can civilisation have reached a point
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.12,0:07:06.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}人们都去加油站买食物
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.12,0:07:06.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}where you buy your food from a petrol station?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.32,0:07:07.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}对 应该在酒吧买才对
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.32,0:07:07.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You should buy it from a pub.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.72,0:07:13.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我的计划只面临一个问题 就是在英国
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.72,0:07:13.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The only problem with my plan is that in the UK,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.44,0:07:17.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}要想在酒吧里开商店
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.44,0:07:17.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}if you want to put a shop in a pub,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.92,0:07:21.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}政府的酒吧警察规定 酒吧必须被规划警察
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.92,0:07:21.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}the government's pub police say that it must be listed
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.52,0:07:25.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}列为E类经营场所才行
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.52,0:07:25.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}by the planning police as a Class E establishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.04,0:07:29.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}欢迎大家来到自由世界
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.04,0:07:29.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Welcome, everyone, to the free world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.56,0:07:37.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}等着瞧吧 这个地方会让你大开眼界的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.56,0:07:37.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You wait till you see this place. It will blow your mind. Ouh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.92,0:07:43.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我找到的这家E类酒吧 位于水上伯顿村的主干道旁
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.92,0:07:43.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The main-road Class E pub I'd found was in Bourton-on-the-Water...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.28,0:07:51.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这里是科茨沃尔德 游客最多的观光小镇
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.28,0:07:51.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The most visited tourist town in the Cotswolds.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.84,0:07:58.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}酒吧名叫"马车与马"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.84,0:07:58.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It was called The Coach & Horses.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.32,0:08:02.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}和该地区的很多酒吧一样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.32,0:08:02.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And like so many pubs in the area,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.80,0:08:05.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}它正在走向破败
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.80,0:08:05.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}it was going to ruin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.64,0:08:13.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}它有四百年历史 非常棒
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.64,0:08:13.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's 400 years old. It's fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.24,0:08:14.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}哇
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.24,0:08:14.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.28,0:08:15.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}现在关门了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.28,0:08:15.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And it's shut.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.72,0:08:16.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}它不断破产
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.72,0:08:16.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It keeps going bankrupt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.12,0:08:22.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这么多年 在这里开店的全都失败了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.12,0:08:22.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Nobody has been able to make it work as a business for donkey's years.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.16,0:08:24.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}为什么 不知道 完全没道理
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.16,0:08:24.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Why? I don't know. It doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.56,0:08:25.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你看 那是石头屋顶
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.56,0:08:25.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Look at it. Look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.60,0:08:29.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不是石板 是石头
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.60,0:08:29.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That is a stone roof. It's not slate, it's stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.68,0:08:30.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}哇
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.68,0:08:30.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.68,0:08:33.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}而且不仅能得到酒吧 还能得到这个
