Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.20,0:12:07.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Don't stand still too long because you'll stick to the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.20,0:12:09.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.20,0:12:09.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Urgh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.68,0:12:10.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}老天爷
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.68,0:12:10.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Urgh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.68,0:12:11.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.68,0:12:11.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Man!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.04,0:12:14.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}太恶心了 他们
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.04,0:12:14.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That is bad! They've... Urgh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.92,0:12:17.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你看 "消防出口"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.92,0:12:17.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Look, "Fire exit". It's just on a wall!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.36,0:12:18.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}在一堵墙上 哪边 这边还是那边
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.36,0:12:18.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Which way? This way or that way?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.80,0:12:21.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}上面写着"消防出口" "消防出口" 快跑
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.80,0:12:21.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It just says... "Fire exit". "Fire exit"! Run.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.52,0:12:22.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}没有箭头
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.52,0:12:22.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No arrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.56,0:12:28.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}还有 装修这里的人是全宇宙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.56,0:12:28.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And then, it was decorated by the laziest man
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.52,0:12:31.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}最懒的人 知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.52,0:12:31.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}in the universe, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.44,0:12:33.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}只是随便刷了一点涂料
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.44,0:12:33.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}"Go in there and give that a lick of paint."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.88,0:12:36.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这里有一个禁止吸烟标牌
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.88,0:12:36.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So he got to this little "No Smoking" sign...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.68,0:12:41.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}只是 对 "我可以把标牌取下来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.68,0:12:41.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}and just thought: "I could take that off the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.64,0:12:43.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}也可以刷点涂料了事"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.64,0:12:43.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Or, I'll just paint over it."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.12,0:12:45.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.12,0:12:45.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.32,0:12:50.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}注意 请不要干扰 这个报警器及其传感器
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.32,0:12:50.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Attention. Please do not interfere with this alarm or any of its sensors.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.68,0:12:52.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}为了避免安保人员迅速赶到
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.68,0:12:52.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}To prevent security officers arriving shortly...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.08,0:12:56.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这是什么鬼东西 请将钥匙放在亮灯处
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.08,0:12:56.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What the fuck is that? ...put your key on the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.52,0:12:59.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你做到了 是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.52,0:12:59.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, you've done it now, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.56,0:13:02.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得我们可以
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.56,0:13:02.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}See, I think what we can do...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.48,0:13:04.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我没有 谁有钥匙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.48,0:13:04.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I haven't got... We've got a key.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.92,0:13:06.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不如把它扔到窗外
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.92,0:13:06.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Look, why don't you just throw it out the window?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.76,0:13:08.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不 别扔 这不是我们的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.76,0:13:08.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No, no, no, don't do that, this is not ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.04,0:13:10.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}噢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.04,0:13:10.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.28,0:13:13.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这个防盗器质量不行 才响了十秒就不响了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.28,0:13:13.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's not a very good burglar alarm if it goes off after ten seconds, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.76,0:13:15.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}最后 我们来到了阁楼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.76,0:13:15.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Finally, we reached the attic,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.48,0:13:19.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}连我也不得不承认 阁楼有点问题
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.48,0:13:19.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}where even I will admit there was a bit of a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.68,0:13:24.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}看了这么多 到目前为止 我认为这是最可怕的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.68,0:13:24.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I think of all the things I've seen so far, this is the scariest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.84,0:13:28.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}什么 你看 这显然是 一根承重梁
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.84,0:13:28.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Because, look, this is obviously a supporting beam,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.76,0:13:31.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}有人把它切断了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.76,0:13:31.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}and somebody has just cut it
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.60,0:13:32.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}以便过去那边
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.60,0:13:32.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}so they can get through there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.16,0:13:34.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}什么 怎么会
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.16,0:13:34.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What? How?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.56,0:13:35.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}他们怎么 因为
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.56,0:13:35.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Where was the--? How did they enter?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.08,0:13:39.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}如果那根梁还在的话
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.08,0:13:39.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}If that beam still existed,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.48,0:13:41.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你就无法穿过这个巨大的门
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.48,0:13:41.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}you wouldn't be able to get to this huge door...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.04,0:13:43.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}对 但是 进入这间卧室
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.04,0:13:43.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, but... Into this bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.72,0:13:46.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这里真的应该有地板吗 是的 还铺了地毯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.72,0:13:46.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Is it actually meant to be a door here? Yes, they've carpeted it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.88,0:13:49.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我很肯定 这道门绝对通不过
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.88,0:13:49.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}This door, I'm fairly confident,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.56,0:13:52.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}建筑检查员的检查 肯定通不过
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.56,0:13:52.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}wouldn't pass muster with the building inspector.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.24,0:13:55.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你做了什么 我做了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.24,0:13:55.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What have you done? What have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.36,0:13:57.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}问得好 我做了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.36,0:13:57.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}"What have I done?" It's a good question!
