Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.12,0:14:01.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What have I done? What have you done? You fucking eejit!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.40,0:14:03.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}导览结束之后
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.40,0:14:03.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}With the guided tour complete,
