Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.84,0:14:06.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Lisa was very moderate in her judgement.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.48,0:14:09.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这个粪坑一样的破地方 只能拆掉重修
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.48,0:14:09.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The only thing that would help this shithole is a wrecking ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.92,0:14:11.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}哪里像粪坑了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.92,0:14:11.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's not a shithole!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.64,0:14:15.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}到目前为止 我没看到半点可取之处
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.64,0:14:15.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, so far, I haven't seen anything redeeming.
