Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.16,0:14:16.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The outside's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.56,0:14:18.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 外面很漂亮 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.56,0:14:18.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The outside's lovely. Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.68,0:14:20.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我买书只看封面 那些值得买
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.68,0:14:20.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I judge a book by its cover.
