Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.52,0:14:26.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}以及纳粹抢来的黄金 我就会买
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.52,0:14:26.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}and some Nazi gold, I'll buy the book.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.84,0:14:32.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}另外 我还有一张王牌 希望能够用来说服她
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.84,0:14:32.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Also, I had one ace up my sleeve that would hopefully convince her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.88,0:14:36.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}最棒的是 这里不属于牛津郡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.88,0:14:36.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Now, the best thing, this isn't in Oxfordshire.
