Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.16,0:14:38.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}This is Gloucestershire.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.52,0:14:42.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}所以不用跟西牛津郡议会打交道 所以归另一个议会管
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.52,0:14:42.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So it's not West Oxfordshire District Council!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.80,0:14:49.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}就在我想方设法说服丽莎的同时
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.80,0:14:49.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}While I was trying to win Lisa over,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.20,0:14:54.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}哈莉特正在直播 她在农场里忙碌的身影
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.20,0:14:54.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}the farm was alive to the sound of a very busy Harriet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.56,0:15:09.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}唯一未能享受直播待遇的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.56,0:15:09.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The one thing that wasn't getting any TikTok treatment, though,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.84,0:15:11.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}便是我的兰博基尼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.84,0:15:11.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}was my Lamborghini,
