Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.00,0:15:17.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}which, with its ever-growing list of age-related problems,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.16,0:15:19.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}她开始对它不耐烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.16,0:15:19.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}was starting to properly annoy her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.32,0:15:22.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}换挡杆的分离器坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.32,0:15:22.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The splitters on the gear stick are broken!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.92,0:15:23.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}坏掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.92,0:15:23.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That's broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.40,0:15:26.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}坏掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.40,0:15:26.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That's broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.76,0:15:30.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}拉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.76,0:15:30.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Pull, pull.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.76,0:15:33.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}拜托
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.76,0:15:33.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.48,0:15:36.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}每过两分钟就跳出来一个故障报警
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.48,0:15:36.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And it throws up a fault signal every two minutes.
