Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.64,0:15:40.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Argh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.96,0:15:47.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.96,0:15:47.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And again!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.48,0:15:48.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.48,0:15:48.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And again!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.52,0:15:52.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}破玩意儿
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.52,0:15:52.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Argh! Fucking thing!
