Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.20,0:19:46.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}If you do the whole farm,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.68,0:19:49.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}它们在那里比在花园里更自然
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.68,0:19:49.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}they're more natural there than they are in the garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.16,0:19:51.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}它们是老情人了 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.16,0:19:51.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}They got the old love match, haven't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.60,0:19:53.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你知道 你走得太快了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.60,0:19:53.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You know, they go too fast...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.40,0:19:59.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不管是不是被杰拉德训斥了一顿
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.40,0:19:59.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}After what may or may not have been a ticking-off from Gerald,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.80,0:20:02.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}回到马车与马酒吧后 我长舒了一口气
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.80,0:20:02.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}it was a relief to get back to The Coach & Horses.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.48,0:20:04.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}所以这里以前是壁炉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.48,0:20:04.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So this would have been an open fire, wouldn't it, back in its day?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.12,0:20:06.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}把上好的木头扔进去烧掉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.12,0:20:06.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Fucking great logs thrown on there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.96,0:20:11.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我相信自己的直觉 所以已经提出了报价
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.96,0:20:11.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Convinced my instincts were right, I'd already put an offer in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.52,0:20:16.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}现在 建筑商阿兰 过来查看哪些地方需要翻修
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.52,0:20:16.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And now, Alan the builder had come over to see what work would be necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.48,0:20:19.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这东西要拆掉 对吧 一点用也没有
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.48,0:20:19.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We're gonna knock this thing down, ain't we? This half penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.96,0:20:23.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}它很漂亮 你喜欢吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.96,0:20:23.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, it's a beauty. You love it? You love it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.28,0:20:25.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}它很漂亮 没有的事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.28,0:20:25.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}She's a beauty! Ain't that ever?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.12,0:20:30.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}把你认为可能会遇到的大问题 列个清单给我们
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.12,0:20:30.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So just give us a list of what you think is going to be a big problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.52,0:20:33.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我不觉得有什么大问题
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.52,0:20:33.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't see a big problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.88,0:20:35.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}什么 没有什么大问题
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.88,0:20:35.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What? No, I don't see a big problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.52,0:20:37.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}有很多小的工作要做
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.52,0:20:37.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}There's lots of little jobs,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.20,0:20:38.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}但是没有大问题 没有什么大问题
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.20,0:20:38.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}but there's not a big problem. Not a big problem here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.04,0:20:41.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}没看到有潮湿的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.04,0:20:41.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I can't see no damp.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.88,0:20:44.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不能移走这段 穿过酒吧的楼梯吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.88,0:20:44.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And we can't move this staircase that goes through the bar?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.16,0:20:46.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}可以 但那样就要
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.16,0:20:46.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, we can, but we'll have to put...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.36,0:20:48.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}对 这是积少成多的问题 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.36,0:20:48.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, it's just accumulation, innit?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.52,0:20:50.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}如果你打算花四十到五十万
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.52,0:20:50.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}If you're gonna spend 400,000 to 500,000,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.28,0:20:53.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}就不需要多花两千英镑移走楼梯了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.28,0:20:53.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}we don't need to move the stairs, do we, for another two thousand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.92,0:20:56.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}抱歉 你说什么 如果我打算花
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.92,0:20:56.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Sorry, what did you just say? "If I'm gonna spend"?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.36,0:21:00.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}大概四十万 五十万 四十五万英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.36,0:21:00.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}About 400,000, 500,000, 450,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.52,0:21:02.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}四十五 万 对
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.52,0:21:02.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}450,000? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.08,0:21:04.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你知道我的想法 四十五万到
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.08,0:21:04.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You know my language with 450,000!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.12,0:21:07.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}四十五万 对
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.12,0:21:07.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}450,000? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.44,0:21:10.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}四十五万 还要有五万英镑的备用金
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.44,0:21:10.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}450,000? To 500,000. A 50,000 contingency.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.36,0:21:12.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}五十万英镑 我知道 有别的说法吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.36,0:21:12.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}500,000, I know what that is. Is there another way of saying that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.08,0:21:14.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}有的 不 没有
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.08,0:21:14.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, well, there is, but, yeah, no, there's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.04,0:21:18.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}四十五万英镑 外加五万英镑的备用金
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.04,0:21:18.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}450,000 with a 50,000 contingency.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.60,0:21:21.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这是英语 科茨沃尔德方言
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.60,0:21:21.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's English! That's the Cotswold talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.84,0:21:22.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}确实是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.84,0:21:22.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The words are!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.92,0:21:24.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}确实
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.92,0:21:24.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes! The words are!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.60,0:21:27.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那我们就 不 等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.60,0:21:27.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So, let's have a- Hold on. Just a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.52,0:21:32.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你认为你能让这里达到开业条件
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.52,0:21:32.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You reckon you could get this operational
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.04,0:21:34.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}报价是四十五万
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.04,0:21:34.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}for 450,000
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.32,0:21:37.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}外加五万英镑的备用金 对
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.32,0:21:37.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}with a £50,000 contingency? Leaving a fifty thousand... Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.04,0:21:40.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}跟你说实话 大实话
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.04,0:21:40.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm gonna be honest with you, really honest with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.68,0:21:42.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我原以为你的报价会更高
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.68,0:21:42.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I was expecting your number to be bigger than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.80,0:21:46.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这很普通 这是一栋普通的科茨沃尔德老建筑 需要翻修
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.80,0:21:46.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's normal, ain't it? It's a normal Cotswold old building needs a renovation.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.36,0:21:49.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}没什么大毛病 只是 有很多工作要做
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.36,0:21:49.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Nothing deeply wrong with it. It's just there's a lot of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.88,0:21:54.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}来到外面 我们讨论了需要怎么做
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.88,0:21:54.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Outside, we discussed what we'd need to do
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.52,0:21:58.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}才能将它打造成餐厅与商店的结合体
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.52,0:21:58.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}to make it into a restaurant and a shop as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.68,0:22:00.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}规划和建筑许可办得怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.68,0:22:00.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What are we doing about planning, then, or building regs?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.80,0:22:03.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我认为
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.80,0:22:03.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, I reckon...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.72,0:22:06.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我跟规划师尼尔谈过了 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.72,0:22:06.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I talked to Neil, the planning man. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.92,0:22:10.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}尼尔说我们需要预申请 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.92,0:22:10.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What Neil says we need is a pre-app. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.32,0:22:11.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}预备申请 我认为 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.32,0:22:11.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Pre-application, I think it's. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.72,0:22:14.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不过他说可能会很难 那是肯定的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.72,0:22:14.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So, but he said it can be very rough. Yeah, yeah, definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.00,0:22:19.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}可以只是"我们想拆掉这个 换成这个" 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.00,0:22:19.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It can just be, "We want to take this bit down and replace it with this,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.44,0:22:21.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}"这是现场俯视图"
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.44,0:22:21.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}here's an aerial view of the site."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.92,0:22:24.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}归哪里管  哪个议会 是威特尼
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.92,0:22:24.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What do we come under? What council? Are we Witney--
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.64,0:22:26.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}科茨沃尔德 科茨沃尔德 对
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.64,0:22:26.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Cotswolds! It's Cotswolds, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.96,0:22:28.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不是西牛津郡 好极了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.96,0:22:28.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's not West Oxfordshire! Cool, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.92,0:22:31.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}如果提交预申请之后 他们说 "看起来不错"
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.92,0:22:31.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But if we do the pre-app, get them to say: "That looks like a good idea."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.12,0:22:32.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}就可以动工了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.12,0:22:32.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.08,0:22:36.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}他说科茨沃尔德 跟西牛津郡完全不同 对
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.08,0:22:36.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}He said Cotswolds' a way different animal to West Oxfordshire.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.72,0:22:38.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}他对他们评价很高 我们得跑一趟
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.72,0:22:38.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}He really rates them. We've gotta get into them, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.84,0:22:41.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 他说这个议会不错 这是好消息
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.84,0:22:41.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, he just says it's a good council. So that's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.48,0:22:44.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}说实话 这栋房子各方面还不错 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.48,0:22:44.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}To be honest, it's all in good nick, ain't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.60,0:22:46.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}屋顶的 丽莎不这么认为
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.60,0:22:46.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That finial on the end- That's not what Lisa said!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.36,0:22:47.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯 但是
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.36,0:22:47.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No, but--
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.52,0:22:49.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们将证明她错了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.52,0:22:49.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We'll put her right!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.88,0:22:55.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}鉴于当务之急是预申请规划
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.88,0:22:55.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Given that the pre-application plans were a priority,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.04,0:22:58.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我接下来要见的人是安妮和斯科特
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.04,0:22:58.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}my next meeting was with Annie and Scott,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.88,0:23:02.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}也就是在农场商店 经营汉堡餐车的那对夫妇
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.88,0:23:02.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}the couple who run the burger van at the farm shop,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.64,0:23:06.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}以便听取他们对于酒吧布局的建议
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.64,0:23:06.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}to get their advice on how the pub should be laid out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.40,0:23:09.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}现在的迫切问题是 要想赶在夏季之前完工
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.40,0:23:09.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Our urgent problem is, if we wanna catch the summer,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.84,0:23:12.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们就得搞定规划方案
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.84,0:23:12.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}which we do, we've gotta get the plans in.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.80,0:23:17.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}一般来说 每位客人 平均需要1.7到1.9平方米
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.80,0:23:17.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The average rule of thumb is between 1.7 and 1.9 square metres per cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.84,0:23:20.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}1.7到1.9 到1.9
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.84,0:23:20.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}1.7 to 1.9...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.24,0:23:22.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}如果打算利用农场的食材
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.24,0:23:22.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}If the goal is to do food from the farm,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.44,0:23:24.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你需要最大限度增加餐桌数量
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.44,0:23:24.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}you need to maximise the number of tables you've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.96,0:23:27.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}也就需要一个相当大的厨房
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.96,0:23:27.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Which you will need a decent-sized kitchen for.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.80,0:23:29.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们在考虑把这些拆掉
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.80,0:23:29.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We're thinking of pulling all this down.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.40,0:23:32.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好 我们打算建一个玻璃房
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.40,0:23:32.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Right. We'll put one of those glass boxes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.64,0:23:33.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不错
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.64,0:23:33.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.68,0:23:38.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}如果规划如我们所愿 这一块也会是餐厅
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.68,0:23:38.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And this will be a restaurant as well, if the plans go as we want them to.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.56,0:23:42.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}最终确定了布局之后
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.56,0:23:42.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}With the layout eventually sorted,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.84,0:23:45.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我得等待规划图的绘制
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.84,0:23:45.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I now had to wait for the plans to be drawn up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.76,0:23:49.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这意味着我可以回去干农活了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.76,0:23:49.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}This meant I could get back to farming.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.68,0:23:53.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}于是我和哈莉特来到蘑菇养殖房补货
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.68,0:23:53.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So, Harriet and I went to the mushroom bunker to restock.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.88,0:23:56.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}生长时间要多久
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.88,0:23:56.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}They take how long to grow?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.60,0:23:59.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}两个礼拜 然后应该就能 两个礼拜
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.60,0:23:59.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Two weeks and then they should be... Two weeks?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.24,0:24:01.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}长出来了 长得够快的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.24,0:24:01.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}...sprouting. That's a quick turnaround.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.20,0:24:03.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 然后所有人都要参与采摘
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.20,0:24:03.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, yeah. And then it's all hands on deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.96,0:24:06.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}蘑菇长出来之后 就没时间干别的农活了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.96,0:24:06.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}There's no time for any other farming once these start growing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.60,0:24:09.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}没时间 好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.60,0:24:09.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}There isn't! Yeah, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.44,0:24:14.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}丽莎今天本来想帮忙的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.44,0:24:14.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Lisa would love to have been helping us today
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.44,0:24:17.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}但她在忙着制作新款香氛 她称之为"赛拉吉"
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.44,0:24:17.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}but she's working on a new scent, which she's calling Silage.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.56,0:24:21.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧 其实是叫"西拉吉"
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.56,0:24:21.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, actually, she's calling it... "Silage".
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.44,0:24:24.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}补充完蘑菇后
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.44,0:24:24.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Having restocked the mushrooms,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.04,0:24:28.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们还得处理查理的鸟食
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.04,0:24:28.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}we had to deal with Charlie's wild bird seed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.84,0:24:31.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}在开车回院子的路上
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.84,0:24:31.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And the drive back to the yard was, for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.52,0:24:35.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我受到了意料之外的深刻启迪
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.52,0:24:35.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}extremely and unexpectedly enlightening.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.20,0:24:41.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 TikTok上面有很多年轻的农民
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.20,0:24:41.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So, on TikTok, there's a lot of young farmers.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.24,0:24:43.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 你们只是在上面跳舞
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.24,0:24:43.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}There is. And all of you just dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.92,0:24:45.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不 我不跳舞
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.92,0:24:45.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't dance!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.48,0:24:46.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}但你会播放音乐
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.48,0:24:46.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, you play music.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.92,0:24:48.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 我 对
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.92,0:24:48.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, I... Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.56,0:24:53.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}但我最初上TikTok 只是为了展示我
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.56,0:24:53.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But the whole reason I started on TikTok was because I was showing me...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.72,0:24:57.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}只是一段我开着拖拉机说唱的视频
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.72,0:24:57.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It was literally just a video of me just driving a tractor, rapping.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.72,0:24:58.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.72,0:24:58.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. Erm...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.08,0:25:01.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}更多地是为了展示
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.08,0:25:01.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And it was more so to show, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.20,0:25:04.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}男人能做到的 女人也能做到
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.20,0:25:04.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}that why can't girls do the exact same that the lads can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.68,0:25:08.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得 是这么回事吗 女人们说 "看 我们可以做到"
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.68,0:25:08.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But is that what's going on? Girls just going, "Look, we can do this"?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.20,0:25:11.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 差不多吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.20,0:25:11.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, yeah, for the most part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.80,0:25:13.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那上面的女生没有男生多
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.80,0:25:13.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}There's less girls than there is lads.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.32,0:25:17.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那上面有很多男生展示自己
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.32,0:25:17.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}There's a lot of lads that, you know, are on it and showing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.84,0:25:19.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我觉得女生也需要展示
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.84,0:25:19.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But that's why I think girls need to go and do it,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.72,0:25:21.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}为什么女生就不行呢
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.72,0:25:21.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}because why can't they do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.20,0:25:25.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得 一个人整天坐在拖拉机上会很孤独
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.20,0:25:25.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}If you're sitting on a tractor all day long, it's quite lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.36,0:25:27.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 整天坐在拖拉机上 确实很孤独
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.36,0:25:27.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, it is very lonely sitting on a tractor all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.60,0:25:29.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}但是有了直播
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.60,0:25:29.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But if you do that, in some way,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.28,0:25:31.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}就能跟别人进行交流 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.28,0:25:31.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}you're connecting with other people. Yeah, I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.76,0:25:34.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}也就不会觉得 一天到晚很孤单了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.76,0:25:34.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So it doesn't feel like you're out there all alone all day long.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.56,0:25:36.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}说实话 大多数时候
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.56,0:25:36.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And, to be fair, for the majority of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.08,0:25:39.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}人们都很友善 会说一些鼓励的话
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.08,0:25:39.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}people are really nice and comment and say, like,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.76,0:25:42.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}为这样做的女生加油
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.76,0:25:42.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}you know, "get on that a girl's doing this" and la-de-da.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.72,0:25:44.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这会让你的心情
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.72,0:25:44.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And it makes you feel a bit...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.40,0:25:45.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}变好 对
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.40,0:25:45.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Better. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.52,0:25:46.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道时下流行讨论心理健康
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.52,0:25:46.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I know everybody talks about "mental health".
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.08,0:25:50.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}以前我称之为"不快乐" 现在叫做"心理健康"了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.08,0:25:50.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I used to call it "being unhappy". But apparently it's "mental health" now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.16,0:25:51.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}农民的心理健康不大好 所以
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.16,0:25:51.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But it's bad in farming, so.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.56,0:25:53.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}简直糟糕透顶
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.56,0:25:53.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's absolutely awful in farming, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.12,0:25:55.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}在我们当地的年轻农民中
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.12,0:25:55.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}In our local young farmers,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.92,0:25:59.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}已经有好几个男的自杀了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.92,0:25:59.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}there's been quite a few lads that have taken their own lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.44,0:26:00.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}开玩笑吧 不是玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.44,0:26:00.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You're kidding? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.40,0:26:02.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你认识很多人 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.40,0:26:02.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You knew people? Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.72,0:26:03.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}因为农场经营不下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.72,0:26:03.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Because they can't get on in farming?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.12,0:26:07.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}有这个原因 还因为太孤独了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.12,0:26:07.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, that, and the fact that it's such a lonely thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.28,0:26:10.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}以及一直都没钱 因为
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.28,0:26:10.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And the fact that they never have any money because...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.48,0:26:11.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}他们是农民 他们是农民
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.48,0:26:11.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, they're farmers. They're farmers.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.88,0:26:14.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}一直都没钱做自己想做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.88,0:26:14.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}They never have the money to do anything they want.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.32,0:26:16.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}整天就是工作 让人非常
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.32,0:26:16.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And, like, all we do is work, work, work.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.60,0:26:20.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}难得有机会出去度假
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.60,0:26:20.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And it's not very often that we go away and get a holiday,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.84,0:26:22.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}首先是因为没钱
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.84,0:26:22.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}one, because we don't have the money for it,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.72,0:26:24.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}其次是没时间
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.72,0:26:24.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}two, because we don't have time to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.16,0:26:26.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}所以非常孤独
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.16,0:26:26.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So it's just... It's lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.64,0:26:30.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不过确实 农民的心理健康是个大问题
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.64,0:26:30.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But, yeah, no, it is a massive thing, mental health in farming.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.40,0:26:33.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}希望TikTok能够有所帮助
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.40,0:26:33.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Hopefully, TikTok helps a bit and brings...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.24,0:26:35.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这能让你接触到相同处境的人
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.24,0:26:35.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It puts you in touch with other people who are in the same boat as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.04,0:26:38.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 那是肯定的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.04,0:26:38.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, for sure. And then somebody goes:
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.88,0:26:41.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}有人会说 "不知所谓 就是坐在那里跳可笑的舞蹈"
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.88,0:26:41.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}"It's pointless sitting there doing that silly dance."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.20,0:26:43.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}当然不知所谓 因为他们是 对
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.20,0:26:43.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And of course it is pointless if you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.96,0:26:45.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}因为他们是扫兴鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.96,0:26:45.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}If you're the Grinch.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.24,0:26:47.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯 我不知道什么是"扫兴鬼" 不过你说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.24,0:26:47.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, I don't know what the "grinch" is. But, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.92,0:26:51.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}所以鸟食在这个谷仓的后面
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.92,0:26:51.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So the bird seeds at the back of this barn.
