Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.64,0:27:20.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So you've borrowed this on a trial loan?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.20,0:27:21.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}对 试用
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.20,0:27:21.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. Demo.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.96,0:27:23.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧 你喜欢吗
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.96,0:27:23.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. Don't you love it?
