Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.24,0:27:34.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Do you know how many horsepower this is?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.20,0:27:36.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不知道 反正不够 有多大
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.20,0:27:36.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, no, not enough. What is it?
