Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.32,0:27:53.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What? The hydraulic flow rate on that
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.92,0:27:58.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}会把过多的油泵进喷雾器 造成喷雾器损坏
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.92,0:27:58.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}will pump too much oil into the sprayer and it'll just break the sprayer.
