Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.64,0:28:03.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那卡莱布是怎么做到的 用他的拖拉机
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.64,0:28:03.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, how does Kaleb do it? On his tractor.
