Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.16,0:28:09.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不行 用不了 绝对不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.16,0:28:09.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No, never fit, never will. Oh...
