Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.96,0:28:14.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Massey Ferguson. They're my tractors.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.40,0:28:18.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧 可怜的老兰博基尼
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.40,0:28:18.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Poor old Lamborghini. He's going to be feeling a little bit put out by--
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.04,0:28:21.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}它会感觉被冷落了 它看起来很可怜 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.04,0:28:21.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, I bet it looks... It just looks poor, doesn't it, now.
