Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.68,0:28:42.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You can actually do that from down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.08,0:28:44.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧 所以它就这么一个功能
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.08,0:28:44.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay, so it's got that one feature.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.76,0:28:47.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不 它还有很多功能
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.76,0:28:47.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No, it's got multiple more.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.16,0:28:49.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}对不住了 兰博基尼
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.16,0:28:49.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Sorry, Lamborghini.
