Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.64,0:29:05.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}尽管我是兰博基尼的忠实用户 我还是暗暗被它迷住了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.64,0:29:05.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Despite my loyalty to Lamborghini, I was secretly intrigued.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.92,0:29:10.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 趁着哈莉特去消灭鼻涕虫了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.92,0:29:10.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So, when Harriet went off to kill some slugs...
