Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.20,0:29:32.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I've got to be honest...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.96,0:29:36.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}太好开了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.96,0:29:36.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}it's quite easy to drive, this.
