Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.16,0:29:46.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Even though I was feeling desperately unfaithful to the Lambo,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.64,0:29:48.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我还是心动了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.64,0:29:48.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}my head was being turned.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.52,0:29:50.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}还带一个平板电脑
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.52,0:29:50.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's got an iPad in it!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.40,0:29:56.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不过 考虑到我只驾驶过 麦赛这一款现代拖拉机
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.40,0:29:56.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But, since the Massey was the only modern tractor I'd ever driven,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.12,0:30:01.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我决定全面出击 再试驾几款别的型号
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.12,0:30:01.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I decided to be thorough and test-drive some others as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.36,0:30:07.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不过在此之前
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.36,0:30:07.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Before I could do any of that, though,
