Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.40,0:30:15.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}to talk to their highways people about how we could deal
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.60,0:30:18.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}酒吧可能带来的 人流量过大的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.60,0:30:18.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}with the possible traffic issues at the pub.
