Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.64,0:30:25.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}嗨 杰里米 我是皮特·邦加德
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.64,0:30:25.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}How are you? Pete Bungard.
