Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.24,0:30:41.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}so the purpose of the pre-application with Cotswold is to talk about
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.64,0:30:43.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们将如何让这个
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.64,0:30:43.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}how we bring this pub, which has been through
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.20,0:30:45.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}过去十年换了八个经营者的酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.20,0:30:45.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}eight different operators in the past ten years,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.08,0:30:49.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}起死回生 让它成为一家成功的企业
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.08,0:30:49.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}bring it back to life, make it a viable business
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.56,0:30:51.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}为水上伯顿村创造价值
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.56,0:30:51.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}and an asset for Bourton-on-the-Water.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.64,0:30:53.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这就是我们此行的目的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.64,0:30:53.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So this is why we're coming to you guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.24,0:30:56.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}因为显然 高速公路 是个需要讨论的重要议题
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.24,0:30:56.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}because obviously the highways is an important bit to talk about
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.60,0:30:58.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这个问题将被解决
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.60,0:30:58.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}and it's getting that bit right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.36,0:31:01.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}鉴于以往参加议会会议的经历
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.36,0:31:01.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Given my experience of council meetings in the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.72,0:31:04.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我没有抱太高的期望
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.72,0:31:04.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}my hopes were not exactly high.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.84,0:31:06.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}关于我们将如何规划
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.84,0:31:06.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}...knowledge as to where we might go with the site.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.92,0:31:11.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}然而
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.92,0:31:11.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}However...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.16,0:31:13.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们支持发展 支持旅游业
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.16,0:31:13.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So, we're pro-development, we're pro-tourism.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.04,0:31:18.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}高速公路管理局的工作 是尽可能开绿灯
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.04,0:31:18.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And the Highway Authority's job is to try and say yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.92,0:31:20.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们的出发点是
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.92,0:31:20.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You know, our starting point is
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.84,0:31:23.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们希望 能够根据实际情况做出相应的调整
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.84,0:31:23.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}we hope we can accommodate the consequences of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.88,0:31:26.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}如果不行 我们会为你们提供建议 使之更加安全
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.88,0:31:26.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}If not, we'll suggest ways you could make it safer.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.04,0:31:29.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们很期待与你们合作
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.04,0:31:29.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We're really, really keen to work with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.56,0:31:32.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}了解你们想要达成的目标
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.56,0:31:32.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}understand what it is that you want to achieve,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.20,0:31:34.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}了解你们之前
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.20,0:31:34.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}understand some of your experiences
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.48,0:31:37.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}在迪丽斯库阿特的相关经验
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.48,0:31:37.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}from your previous endeavours at Diddly Squat,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.84,0:31:40.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}看看能否从中吸取经验教训
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.84,0:31:40.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}and to see whether or not we can take some of that learning
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.60,0:31:44.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}从而缓和或者避免其中一些问题
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.60,0:31:44.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}and make sure that we can mitigate or avoid some of those issues
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.76,0:31:46.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}从表面上看
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.76,0:31:46.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}on what is, on the face of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.80,0:31:51.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这是一个激动人心的投资机会 很好地连接了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.80,0:31:51.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}a very exciting investment opportunity that links in very much...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.16,0:31:55.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}会议就在这种氛围中继续 结果很乐观
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.16,0:31:55.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The meeting continued in this vein to a very promising conclusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.68,0:31:57.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}很高兴见到你 谢谢 很高兴见到你
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.68,0:31:57.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It was very nice to meet you. Thank you. Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.76,0:31:59.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}希望对你们有用
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.76,0:31:59.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Hopefully that was useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.36,0:32:01.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}非常好 是的 很高兴见到你
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.36,0:32:01.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It was very good, yes. Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.32,0:32:03.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}非常感谢 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.32,0:32:03.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Thank you very much. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.72,0:32:10.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}第二天 又有新的好消息传来
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.72,0:32:10.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And the following day, there was more good news
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.64,0:32:15.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们终于找到方法 把猪运到屠宰场了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.64,0:32:15.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}because we'd finally found a way of transporting the pigs to slaughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.04,0:32:22.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}查理在班伯里附近找到了一个农民 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.04,0:32:22.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Charlie has found a farmer near Banbury. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.24,0:32:23.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}他安排了一辆卡车
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.24,0:32:23.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And he's organised a lorry
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.00,0:32:28.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}依次前往有待宰动物的农场
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.00,0:32:28.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}to go round all the farms with animals that need slaughtering,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.84,0:32:31.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}依次上门将动物装车 运到屠宰场
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.84,0:32:31.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}and it's sort of going round picking them up and then takes them there.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.64,0:32:33.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}而且只收一百英镑 那太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.64,0:32:33.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And it's only a hundred quid. That's incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.00,0:32:36.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}像校车一样 动物农场校车
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.00,0:32:36.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's like the school run. Animal-farm school run.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.96,0:32:40.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你好 早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.96,0:32:40.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Hey yup! Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.72,0:32:42.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.72,0:32:42.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Morning, morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.80,0:32:46.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}小猪 来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.80,0:32:46.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Piggies! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.24,0:32:48.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}来吧 来吧 小猪 走了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.24,0:32:48.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on! Come on, piggies!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.32,0:32:50.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}来吧 孩子们 快来
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.32,0:32:50.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Here we go. Come on, boys. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.08,0:32:53.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}多少头了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.08,0:32:53.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}How many have we got there?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.28,0:32:55.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}十头了 十头 干得漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.28,0:32:55.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Is that ten? Ten. Lovely job.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.68,0:33:00.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}把猪赶上车后 我们一溜烟开到院子里
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.68,0:33:00.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}With the pigs loaded up, we scooted over to the yard
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.08,0:33:02.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}等着校车前来
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.08,0:33:02.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}to wait for the school bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.44,0:33:07.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我的老天
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.44,0:33:07.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Bloody Nora!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.48,0:33:10.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好大的卡车 最大的校车
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.48,0:33:10.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That's a big wagon. That's the biggest school bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.88,0:33:13.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那是一辆校车
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.88,0:33:13.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That is a school bus right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.04,0:33:15.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.04,0:33:15.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.32,0:33:17.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}早上好 你好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.32,0:33:17.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Morning. How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.76,0:33:19.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}很好 你呢 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.76,0:33:19.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Good. How are you? Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.36,0:33:21.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你们牛 猪
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.36,0:33:21.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So, do you take cows, pigs,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.20,0:33:22.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}羊 什么都运吗 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.20,0:33:22.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}sheep, everything? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.80,0:33:24.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是双层货车吗 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.80,0:33:24.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Is that a double-decker? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.20,0:33:25.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}哇
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.20,0:33:25.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.40,0:33:28.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}走了 快 走了 快
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.40,0:33:28.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on, then! Up, up!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.88,0:33:30.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}再见 猪猪们
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.88,0:33:30.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Bye, pigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.68,0:33:34.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}救了我们的燃眉之急 不是救它们
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.68,0:33:34.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You saved our bacon, not theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.64,0:33:38.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}多谢 给猪警察的准运证
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.64,0:33:38.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Thank you very much. Movement order for the pig police.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.92,0:33:40.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}谢谢 回见
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.92,0:33:40.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Thank you. See you soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.76,0:33:43.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这主意太妙了 沃尔沃XC90
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.76,0:33:43.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's a bloody good idea. The Volvo XC90.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.04,0:33:46.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}货运校车 运牲畜的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.04,0:33:46.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}School-run lorry. Of the livestock world!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.40,0:33:50.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}没错 运牲畜的XC90 完全正确 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.40,0:33:50.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It is! The XC90 of the livestock world! Exactly right!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.84,0:33:53.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}下次见 谢谢 保重
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.84,0:33:53.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We'll see you again. Thank you, guys. Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.76,0:34:08.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}几天后
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.76,0:34:08.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}A couple of days later,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.40,0:34:13.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我向丽莎提议 我们应该去当地酒吧来一次约会之夜
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.40,0:34:13.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I suggested to Lisa that we should go to our local pub for a date night.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.36,0:34:20.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}以便我在浪漫的氛围中 解释我的酒吧计划
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.36,0:34:20.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So that I could romantically explain the plans for my pub.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.28,0:34:24.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.28,0:34:24.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So, here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.80,0:34:29.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这是预规划申请 目的就是告诉议会
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.80,0:34:29.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's a pre-planning-application thing. It just says to the council:
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.20,0:34:33.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}"这是我们的想法 告诉你们一声"
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.20,0:34:33.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}"This is what we've got in mind, just so you know."
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.68,0:34:35.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}就是这个目的 所以这里是酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.68,0:34:35.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That's all it says. So here's the pub.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.16,0:34:38.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}就是这里
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.16,0:34:38.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That's that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.48,0:34:42.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这里是玻璃墙 这里是玻璃墙 房顶
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.48,0:34:42.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You put a glass wall here, a glass wall there, roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.40,0:34:45.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}所以是冬天冻死 夏天热死
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.40,0:34:45.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So in the wintertime it will be freezing and in the summer it will be boiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.88,0:34:47.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道你来自爱尔兰
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.88,0:34:47.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, no. I know you're from Ireland,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.48,0:34:50.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}但我们这里有种东西叫做暖气
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.48,0:34:50.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}but over here we have something called central heating
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.40,0:34:52.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}以及空调
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.40,0:34:52.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}and air conditioning.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.72,0:34:55.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}然后厨房在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.72,0:34:55.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And then, the kitchen is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.84,0:35:00.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你可以从这里或这里进入酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.84,0:35:00.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And then, you come through here, or through that, into the drinking bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.16,0:35:03.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}丝毫没有"天哪 好高档"的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.16,0:35:03.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}There's nothing that makes you feel, "Oh, God, it's all a bit posh, this."
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.04,0:35:05.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}一切都很简单实在
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.04,0:35:05.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's all very straightforward, down-to-earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.12,0:35:07.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}东西好吃 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.12,0:35:07.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Good food. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.48,0:35:10.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}没有花里胡哨的东西 必须要有黄铜马饰
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.48,0:35:10.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No frills. Horse brasses, definitely having those.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.00,0:35:13.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我想铺一块带图案的地毯
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.00,0:35:13.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I'd love a bit of patterned carpet somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.24,0:35:15.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}在后面挂一块大牌子 上面写着"唐卡斯特流浪者"
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.24,0:35:15.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}With a big sign at the back saying "Doncaster Rovers".
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.60,0:35:17.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}带图案的地毯 对 圆圈图案
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.60,0:35:17.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Patterned carpet? Yeah, squirly-whirly.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.32,0:35:19.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}铺这种地毯的目的只有一个 就是有人吐在上面时
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.32,0:35:19.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The only reason they had patterned carpet is when people vomited on them,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.12,0:35:22.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}看不出来 不要带图案的地毯
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.12,0:35:22.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}it wouldn't show. We're not having patterned carpet.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.32,0:35:25.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}总之 这就是我的打算 好
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.32,0:35:25.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Anyway, that's the plan. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.76,0:35:27.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我希望酒吧的食物超级好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.76,0:35:27.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And I want to make a pub
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.68,0:35:32.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}采用英国的食材 以便支持英国的农民
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.68,0:35:32.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}with really good food from British farmers, so we're supporting British farmers,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.92,0:35:34.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}同时价格还不贵
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.92,0:35:34.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}that isn't expensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.92,0:35:37.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我想以公道的价格采购他们的农产品
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.92,0:35:37.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm gonna pay proper money for their produce.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.96,0:35:40.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我还要想办法
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.96,0:35:40.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And then, I have to somehow work out a way
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.48,0:35:45.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}把它打造成有史以来 经营成本最低的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.48,0:35:45.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}of making this the cheapest-to-run pub
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.20,0:35:47.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.20,0:35:47.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.76,0:35:49.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你可以雇用罪犯
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.76,0:35:49.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You could hire convicts.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.84,0:35:51.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}但我闭上眼睛就能看见它
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.84,0:35:51.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But if I close my eyes I can see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.92,0:35:54.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}懂你的意思了 我觉得这个主意很不错
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.92,0:35:54.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I hear you, I hear you, but I just think it's a great idea,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.92,0:35:57.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}但你需要做些功课 尤其是在花钱的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.92,0:35:57.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}but you need to do some homework, especially when you have to spend money.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.92,0:36:00.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你不是很擅长花钱 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.92,0:36:00.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I know. You're not the best at spending money.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.20,0:36:01.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}所以一切会很惊人
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.20,0:36:01.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So that's all going to be a shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.72,0:36:03.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}但如果我们留在这里喝得大醉
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.72,0:36:03.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But, if we stay here and get massively pissed,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.80,0:36:05.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}它看起来就没那么让人望而生畏了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.80,0:36:05.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}it won't seem quite so daunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.24,0:36:11.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不过很可惜 我们得早点回家睡觉了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.24,0:36:11.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Sadly, though, we had to go home for an early night.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.48,0:36:17.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}因为第二天一早 还有一场大型拖拉机试驾活动
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.48,0:36:17.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Because the following morning, we had the big tractor test.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.12,0:36:22.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}伤感的一天
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.12,0:36:22.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Sad day.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.84,0:36:25.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我是说 它有多少 20
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.84,0:36:25.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, it's 20...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.60,0:36:28.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}有12到13年了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.60,0:36:28.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So it's... 12, 13 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.80,0:36:30.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得它几年前就该退休了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.80,0:36:30.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I think it should have retired a couple of years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.76,0:36:32.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}说真的 刹车从来都刹不住
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.76,0:36:32.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's just the brakes never work.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.12,0:36:35.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}没错 动不动就烧保险丝
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.12,0:36:35.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}They don't. It blows fuses all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.52,0:36:38.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}没错 这是我们花了四万英镑买的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.52,0:36:38.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It does. We paid forty thousand for this one
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.48,0:36:39.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}买了五年了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.48,0:36:39.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}five years ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.80,0:36:43.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这个价格非常不错 四万英镑太划算了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.80,0:36:43.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That's been really good. For forty grand, that's been amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.28,0:36:46.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道 当时我说花了四万英镑 所有人都笑话我
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.28,0:36:46.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I know, and everybody laughed at me when I said I've spent £40,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.16,0:36:48.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}"你花四万英镑买了一台兰博基尼"
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.16,0:36:48.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}"You've spent £40,000 on a Lamborghini?"
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.32,0:36:49.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}简直太便宜了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.32,0:36:49.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That's phenomenally cheap!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.68,0:36:51.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你知道哈莉特
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.68,0:36:51.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You know that Massey Ferguson
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.28,0:36:52.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}借来的那台麦赛福格森吧 知道 很不错
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.28,0:36:52.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}that Harriet's borrowing? Yeah, it's very sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.44,0:36:53.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你知道那台要多少钱吗
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.44,0:36:53.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Do you know how much that costs?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.44,0:36:56.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}十六万英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.44,0:36:56.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}160,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.20,0:36:58.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}十六万
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.20,0:36:58.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Wow. 160,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.76,0:37:00.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好贵 总之 我打算看看
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.76,0:37:00.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That's a lot. But anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.32,0:37:04.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}如果这是一台兰博基尼 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.32,0:37:04.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So I'm going to look. If this is a Lamborghini... Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.16,0:37:07.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我决定看看高尔夫系列的拖拉机
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.16,0:37:07.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I've decided to have a look at the "Golf" range of tractors.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.48,0:37:09.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}如果把拖拉机想象成内衣
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.48,0:37:09.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Think of it in terms of underwear. Hm-mm.
