Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.08,0:37:12.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}This is Agent Provocateur.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.32,0:37:16.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我想看看"布里吉特·琼斯的米色大裤衩"那种类型的拖拉机
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.32,0:37:16.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm gonna look at the Bridget Jones beige, big pants tractors.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.84,0:37:18.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你看
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.84,0:37:18.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.20,0:37:23.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}就在那时 布里吉特·琼斯缓缓开了过来
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.20,0:37:23.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}At that moment, Bridget Jones came trundling up the drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.40,0:37:27.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}绿色 所以是强鹿牌的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.40,0:37:27.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's green, so it's a John Deere.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.88,0:37:30.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}猜猜价格
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.88,0:37:30.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Take a guess how much.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.80,0:37:31.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这么小一台
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.80,0:37:31.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}For this little thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.68,0:37:36.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}22.3万英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.68,0:37:36.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}£223,000. Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.76,0:37:38.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}早上好 约翰
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.76,0:37:38.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Morning, John.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.96,0:37:40.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}强鹿 早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.96,0:37:40.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}John Deere! Morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.24,0:37:43.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你知道约翰·迪尔有个趣闻吗 不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.24,0:37:43.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Do you know an interesting thing about John Deere? I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.24,0:37:44.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道 你知道
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.24,0:37:44.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I do. Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.48,0:37:46.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}他一辈子没见过拖拉机
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.48,0:37:46.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}He never saw a tractor in his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.32,0:37:48.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.32,0:37:48.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Did you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.32,0:37:50.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}没错 是真的 这是事实
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.32,0:37:50.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, that's true! It's a true fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.44,0:37:54.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}只有四个气缸
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.44,0:37:54.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's only got four cylinders.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.92,0:37:57.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那你需要几个气缸
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.92,0:37:57.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, how many cylinders do you need, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.68,0:37:58.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}通常是八个
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.68,0:37:58.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, eight, usually.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.12,0:38:02.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}送货的来了 这是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.12,0:38:02.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Uh-oh, we've got a delivery. Who's this? What's...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.04,0:38:06.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这是另一台拖拉机 你要这么多干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.04,0:38:06.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, it's another tractor. Why would you get more than one?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.76,0:38:09.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我全都找来了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.76,0:38:09.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I've got them all. All of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.36,0:38:10.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}全部 "全部"是多少
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.36,0:38:10.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What's "all of them"?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.96,0:38:12.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}八台
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.96,0:38:12.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.24,0:38:13.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}今天要来八台 八台
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.24,0:38:13.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Eight coming today? Eight?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.84,0:38:17.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}老天爷 你做了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.84,0:38:17.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Ah, Jesus. What have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.88,0:38:23.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你没想到会用拖挂车拉来吧 白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.88,0:38:23.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You didn't realise they were gonna come on trailers, did you? Eejit.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.20,0:38:25.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}老天爷
