Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.84,0:46:37.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.64,0:46:42.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}科茨沃尔德议会 不允许我们拍摄这次会议
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.64,0:46:42.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The Cotswold Council wouldn't allow us to film the meeting,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.16,0:46:45.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}所以拍摄只能到此为止
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.16,0:46:45.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}so we had to cut cameras at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.08,0:46:52.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不过后来 查理 尼尔和我 在一家咖啡馆碰头
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.08,0:46:52.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But afterwards, Charlie, Neil and I met up in a café
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.92,0:46:55.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}讨论了事情的进展
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.92,0:46:55.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}to discuss how it had gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.44,0:46:58.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好了 伙计们 拜托 我是说
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.44,0:46:58.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay, guys, come on. I mean, I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.56,0:47:01.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我无法相信
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.56,0:47:01.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm just... I cannot believe
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.60,0:47:04.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们又回到了原点
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.60,0:47:04.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}we're back where we started from.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.12,0:47:07.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我得告诉大家发生了什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.12,0:47:07.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I have to tell the ladies and gentlemen what's happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.20,0:47:11.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我真心想在西牛津郡以外
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.20,0:47:11.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I genuinely looked for a pub
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.88,0:47:14.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}找一家酒吧 以便摆脱
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.88,0:47:14.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}out of West Oxfordshire to get away
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.12,0:47:17.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}西牛津郡区议会的控制
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.12,0:47:17.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}from West Oxfordshire District Council.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.60,0:47:18.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}结果到了会议室
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.60,0:47:18.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Turn up at the meeting,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.32,0:47:21.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}有一个人通过视频软件参加了会议
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.32,0:47:21.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}and who should be sitting there, on Zoom,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.96,0:47:25.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们的死对头 西牛津郡区议会的菲尔肖
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.96,0:47:25.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}but Phil Shaw, our nemesis from West Oxfordshire District Council,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.72,0:47:28.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}原来他还是格洛斯特郡 管理规划的官员
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.72,0:47:28.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}who's also the planning officer for over here in Gloucestershire.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.40,0:47:31.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}还有一个伯顿议会的人
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.40,0:47:31.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And we had a man from Bourton Council,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.00,0:47:34.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}他一句好话都没说
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.00,0:47:34.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}and he just didn't have a single positive thing to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.96,0:47:36.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}一句好话都没说
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.96,0:47:36.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}not one single positive thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.16,0:47:39.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}他很担心当地的居民 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.16,0:47:39.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}He was very concerned, wasn't he, about his residents.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.08,0:47:43.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}"人们会前往这个酒吧" 对 "他们会去"
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.08,0:47:43.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}"Well, people are going to come to your pub. They're going to come."
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.96,0:47:45.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道他们会去 不然我干嘛开酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.96,0:47:45.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I know they are, that's the point of a pub.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.48,0:47:47.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我记下了一些正面的意见
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.48,0:47:47.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I wrote down the positives and...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.68,0:47:49.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}肯定没多少
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.68,0:47:49.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, well, that's a short list.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.16,0:47:50.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯 还是有一些
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.16,0:47:50.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah! Well, there were some.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.64,0:47:53.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}他们确实承认 12年间这家酒吧换了八个业主
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.64,0:47:53.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}They did accept... I mean, the pub's had eight owners in twelve years.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.04,0:47:56.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那个人说酒吧经营状况不佳 对 确实
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.04,0:47:56.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The guy said it's just not doing very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.44,0:47:59.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}12年换了八个业主 全都失败了 12年 对
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.44,0:47:59.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Eight owners in twelve years, all failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.28,0:48:03.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们来了 我们会让酒吧成功 "这正是我们担心的"
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.28,0:48:03.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We come along, we'll make a success of it. "Oh, that's what we're worried about."
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.24,0:48:06.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}他们就担心酒吧成功
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.24,0:48:06.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That is genuinely what they're worried about, because:
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.60,0:48:07.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}因为"这会带来很大的人流量"
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.60,0:48:07.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}"Oh, you'll bring a lot of people."
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.92,0:48:10.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那是好事啊 他们说 "主题公园"
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.92,0:48:10.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, that's good. They said "theme park".
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.52,0:48:13.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}"你们要开的是主题公园" 明明是一个带餐厅和商店的酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.52,0:48:13.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}"You're gonna open a theme park." No, it's a pub with a restaurant and a shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.44,0:48:16.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}据我所知 迪士尼乐园可没有肉店
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.44,0:48:16.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Disneyland does not have butcher shops in it, as far as I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.64,0:48:19.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}没有 我真心相信
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.64,0:48:19.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No. I honestly believed,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.48,0:48:24.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}因为它现在就是酒吧 因为它最终会破败 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.48,0:48:24.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}because it is an existing pub and because it will eventually crumble,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.52,0:48:26.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}因为除了我们 没有人会买下它
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.52,0:48:26.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}'cause nobody's gonna buy it apart from us,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.84,0:48:28.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}他们会迫不及待地接受的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.84,0:48:28.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}they would bite our hands off.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.52,0:48:31.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不过经过这件事 我有点泄气 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.52,0:48:31.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But I'm filled with gloom after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.16,0:48:38.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我想在八月份的银行假期周末之前
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.16,0:48:38.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I want to get this open by...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.56,0:48:42.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}把酒吧开起来
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.56,0:48:42.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}the August Bank Holiday weekend. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.76,0:48:46.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}规划申请不会一帆风顺 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.76,0:48:46.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}There's going to be nothing smooth about this planning application, is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.20,0:48:50.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}也许是时候
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.20,0:48:50.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I think it might be time to have
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.72,0:48:53.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}重新考虑了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.72,0:48:53.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}a bit of a rethink.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.76,0:48:57.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不 丽莎
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.76,0:48:57.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No, Lisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.36,0:49:00.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你上一次给动物接生 是什么时候 闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.36,0:49:00.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}When was the last time you gave birth to anything? Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.68,0:49:02.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}空间流动性很好
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.68,0:49:02.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It has a good flow to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.12,0:49:05.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}非常非常漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.12,0:49:05.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Very, very charming.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.20,0:49:06.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.20,0:49:06.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You're back!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.40,0:49:09.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你还好吧 我不得不找了个帮手
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.40,0:49:09.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You all right? I had to get someone to help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.36,0:49:11.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你将见到哈莉特 你会喜欢她的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.36,0:49:11.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You'll meet Harriet. You'll like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.96,0:49:41.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}字幕翻译 刘波
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.96,0:49:44.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}创意监督 张珺怡
